## REFACTORING ROADMAP

### Phase 1: Critical Security Fixes (Week 1)
1. Implement path traversal prevention (C1)
2. Add input validation for profile/mode IDs (C2)
3. Add HTTP response size limits (C3)
4. Fix file permission validation (H2)

### Phase 2: Concurrency & Atomicity (Week 2)
1. Fix race conditions in state file operations (H1)
2. Add temp file cleanup on startup (M1)
3. Standardize date formats (H3)

### Phase 3: Code Quality & Parity (Week 3)
1. Add JSON schema validation (H4)
2. Standardize error handling patterns (M2)
3. Fix profile loading order (M4)
4. Add JSDoc/type hints (L1)

### Phase 4: Testing & Validation (Week 4)
1. Add unit tests for all validation functions
2. Add integration tests for concurrent access
3. Add security penetration tests
4. Add parity validation tests

